{"ref":"BDB, חוּפָם","hw":"חוּפָם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חוּפָם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> head of a Benjamite family <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:39\" href=\"/Numbers.26.39\">Nu 26:39</a>, not in 𝔊; (= <span dir=\"rtl\">חֻפִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:21\" href=\"/Genesis.46.21\">Gn 46:21</a>, cf. also <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.12\">1 Ch 7:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.15\">15</a>).","next":"BDB, חוּפָמִי","prev":"BDB, חוֹף"}